      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i have a 2018 honda civic and i keep hearing this loud squealing noise whenever i step on the gas to accelerate. i think it might be the serpentine belt but can u explain what that belt actually does and why a bad one would make that sound?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
